Only public static research, card and workshop index/name mappings are vendored
in catalog/game-export-mappings.v1.json. SDK code and account exports are not
included. Local canonical IDs and aliases were added against concepts.v1.json;
unrecognized names retain a null ID, and padding/index holes remain intact.
Runtime uses no SDK dependency. Names and indexes are community data and are
not an official promise of stability; unsupported versions produce warnings.
